  <!-- Settings: Persona costs -->
  <!-- EN: First trait costs an AI persona core -->
  <PWU_FirstTraitCostsPersonaCore>第一項特性需消耗一個人格核心</PWU_FirstTraitCostsPersonaCore>
  <!-- EN: When enabled (default), adding the first trait to a base weapon installs an AI persona core, which is refunded when the last trait is removed and the weapon reverts to base. When disabled, the first trait added and the last trait removed are priced like any other change: advanced components (scaled by weapon quality per the table below), which are never refunded. -->
  <PWU_FirstTraitCostsPersonaCoreDesc>啟用時(預設)，為基礎武器加入第一項特性會裝設一個人格核心；當最後一項特性被移除、武器還原為基礎型態時，該核心會被退還。停用時，加入的第一項特性與移除的最後一項特性都與其他變更同樣計價：消耗高級零件(依下表按武器品質調整)，且永不退還。</PWU_FirstTraitCostsPersonaCoreDesc>
  <!-- EN: Base component cost per trait change: {0} -->
  <PWU_TraitChangeBaseComponentCost>每次特性變更的基礎零件花費：{0}</PWU_TraitChangeBaseComponentCost>
  <!-- EN: Advanced components charged for every trait change that doesn't cross the base/persona boundary (both additions and removals cost, neither refunds). Charged regardless of the weapon's quality. Installing a persona core on the first trait, or refunding it on the last, is unaffected by this setting. -->
  <PWU_TraitChangeBaseComponentCostDesc>每次未跨越基礎型態與羈絆武器型態界線的特性變更所收取的高級零件(加入與移除都需花費，兩者皆不退還)。無論武器品質為何都會收取。第一項特性裝設人格核心、或最後一項特性退還人格核心，均不受此設定影響。</PWU_TraitChangeBaseComponentCostDesc>
  <!-- EN: Quality surcharge threshold: {0} -->
  <PWU_TraitChangeQualitySurchargeThreshold>品質附加費門檻：{0}</PWU_TraitChangeQualitySurchargeThreshold>
  <!-- EN: The weapon quality tier at which the per-level component surcharge below starts applying. Trait changes on weapons at or below this quality cost only the base component amount. -->
  <PWU_TraitChangeQualitySurchargeThresholdDesc>下方每級零件附加費開始生效的武器品質等級。品質等於或低於此門檻的武器進行特性變更時，只需支付基礎零件數量。</PWU_TraitChangeQualitySurchargeThresholdDesc>
  <!-- EN: Quality surcharge per level: {0} -->
  <PWU_TraitChangeQualitySurchargePerLevel>每級品質附加費：{0}</PWU_TraitChangeQualitySurchargePerLevel>
  <!-- EN: Extra advanced components charged per quality tier above the surcharge threshold. For example, at the default threshold (Normal) and per-level value (1), a Masterwork weapon costs 3 more components per trait change than the base amount. -->
  <PWU_TraitChangeQualitySurchargePerLevelDesc>高於附加費門檻的每個品質等級所額外收取的高級零件。例如，在預設門檻(普通)與每級數值(1)之下，一把大師品質的武器每次特性變更會比基礎數量多花費3個零件。</PWU_TraitChangeQualitySurchargePerLevelDesc>
